      "markdown": "| Reference   | Description       |\n|-------------|-------------------|\n| (1)         | Compressor Outlet |\n| (2)         | Element Outlet    |\n| (3)         | Menu              |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0260",
      "reading_order": 396,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 466.5016,
        "r": 515.151299999999,
        "b": 454.32460000000003
      },
      "content": "To call-up more information, select the icon using the scroll keys (1) and press the enter key (2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0261",
      "reading_order": 397,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 447.3616,
        "r": 164.92230000000004,
        "b": 435.18460000000005
      },
      "content": "Status bar (C)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0262",
      "reading_order": 398,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 428.2216,
        "r": 296.1577999999999,
        "b": 416.04460000000006
      },
      "content": "Action buttons (D). These buttons are used:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0263",
      "reading_order": 399,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.9099,
        "t": 409.08160000000004,
        "r": 523.348499999999,
        "b": 396.9046000000001
      },
      "content": "to call-up or program settings to reset a motor overload, service message or emergency stop"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0264",
      "reading_order": 400,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.9099,
        "t": 389.88110000000006,
        "r": 342.62289999999973,
        "b": 377.7041000000001
      },
      "content": "to have access to all data collected by the regulator"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0265",
      "reading_order": 401,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 370.7411000000001,
        "r": 504.6462999999989,
        "b": 358.5641000000001
      },
      "content": "The function of the buttons depends on the displayed menu. The  most common functions are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0027",
      "reading_order": 402,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 86.16571807861328,
        "t": 342.2953186035156,
        "r": 562.6065063476562,
        "b": 242.37811279296875
      },
      "markdown": "| Designation   | Function                         |\n|---------------|----------------------------------|\n| Back          | To return to the previous screen |\n| Mainscreen    | To return to the main screen     |\n| Menu          | To go to the menu                |\n| Modify        | To modify programmable settings  |\n| Reset         | To reset a timer or message      |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0266",
      "reading_order": 403,
      "section": "Text on figures",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 217.56060000000002,
        "r": 515.9003999999992,
        "b": 205.38360000000011
      },
      "content": "To activate an action button, highlight the button by using the scroll keys and press the enter key."
    },
